# The agent-deck orchestrator tree is NOT public. Its instruction tier now lives
# in the private overlay repo and is seeded from there copy-once, so chezmoi must
# not manage it here. Ignoring only makes the target unmanaged -- chezmoi never
# deletes an ignored path, and the live tree is left exactly as it is.
# Do not re-add it with `chezmoi add`.
